# Design Sync Rule

## Objective
Ensure Figma context is consistently mapped to executable tasks and acceptance criteria.

## Required Inputs
- Figma URL and/or node IDs.
- Current task tree (`project-spec/10-tasks.json`).
- Current design map (`project-spec/06-design-map.json`).

## Mapping Rules
- Screen maps to epic.
- Component maps to task.
- State/variant maps to acceptance criteria.
- Design tokens map to implementation constraints.

## Quality Rules
- Do not mark UI task complete without at least one verified design mapping.
- Preserve mapping confidence and relation type.
- Keep unmapped design nodes visible as gaps.

## Delivery Rule
- Design map updates must be versioned and exportable.
- When design and task artifacts conflict, require human review before handoff.
